REQUIREMENT DOCUMENT
1. Project Title

StudentHub Portal

2. Project Objective

The StudentHub Portal is a simple website developed for students. It allows students to log in and view information such as courses, attendance, assignments, results, profile, and contact details.

3. Project Description

StudentHub Portal is a web-based application created using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The website provides different pages for students to access academic information through a simple and user-friendly interface.

4. Software Requirements
Visual Studio Code
Google Chrome / Microsoft Edge
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript

5. Hardware Requirements
Computer or Laptop
Minimum 4 GB RAM
Keyboard and Mouse
Internet Connection (Optional)

6. Technologies Used
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript

