9. Functional Requirements
User can open the website.
User can log in using the Login page.
User can navigate to different pages.
User can view attendance details.
User can check available courses.
User can view assignments.
User can see examination results.
User can view their profile.
User can access the contact page.

10. Non-Functional Requirements
Easy to use
Simple user interface
Fast loading pages
Responsive design
Compatible with modern web browsers

